      "instance_name": "determined_resilience",
      "label": "determined resilience emotion",
      "description": "The woman aiming the bow and arrow displays a focused, intense expression, conveying determination and readiness to face adversity. This emotion reflects self-reliance and preparedness in the face of crisis, aligning with the stereotype of women being capable and proactive in survival situations.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
